   "backdrop": null,
   "prompt": "Build nursing side buttons like Huckleberry's.\n- Two 138 pt circles, #FD763F, centers 176 pt apart, on a white screen.\n- Dashed halo around each: r 77 pt, 2.4 pt #FED6C5 stroke, 40 round-capped dashes per turn.\n- Inside: white play triangle 19.4 x 23.9 pt, 1.5 pt round corners, top 46 pt below the button top, 3 pt right of center.\n- Label: LEFT or RIGHT in Oswald Regular 23 pt, white, baseline 100 pt below the button top.\n- Badge: 52 pt #6A6A6A circle on the RIGHT halo at 1 o'clock. Text: Last / Side on 2 lines, Lexend Semibold 11.5 pt, white, 12.3 pt line height.\n- Running state: pause icon and an mm:ss count, the halo turns once every 20 s, the other button drops to 50% opacity.\n- Data rule: the badge marks the side that ran last.\n- Pressed: scale 0.96 for 120 ms.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  },
