   "prompt": "Build view and log type tabs like Huckleberry's.\n- White header, full width, 111 pt tall, 15 pt side margins.\n- Segmented control 311 x 34 pt, 1 pt #E5E4E9 border and dividers, 4.2 pt corners: Day, Week, List, Summary in equal segments.\n- Labels: Lexend Light 10.5 pt, #4B505F. Selected: #8FD33D fill, white label.\n- Filter icon 16.4 pt at the right: 2 lines (1.1 pt, #738497), each with a 6.6 pt open circle.\n- Tab row, baseline 74 pt below the control top: Sleep, Feed, Solids, Diaper/Potty, Pump in Lexend Light 16 pt, 27.7 pt apart. Active #4A5265, others #C7CBD1.\n- Underline: 2.2 pt #8FD33D bar with round ends, as wide as the active label, 15 pt below its baseline.\n- Shadow: 10 pt gradient #DEDEDE to #FFFFFF under the header.\n- States: a segment tap switches the time view. A tab tap slides the underline to it in 250 ms; the tab row scrolls sideways.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
