   "why": "The donut splits 14h 16m of daily sleep into nap (3h 7m) and night (11h 9m), and 1 grey line states the trend: 1h more than last week.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends\"><div class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__title\">Sleep Trends</div><div class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__pick\"></div><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range--1\">7D</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range--2\">14D</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range--3\">30D</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range--4\">90D</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__range--5\">1Y</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__dot x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__dot--nap\"></span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__key x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__key--nap\">Nap total avg</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__val x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__val--nap\">3h 7m</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__dot x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__dot--night\"></span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__key x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__key--night\">Night total avg</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__val x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__val--night\">11h 9m</span><svg class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__donut\" viewBox=\"0 0 376 337\" width=\"376\" height=\"337\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__arc\" d=\"M275.65 134.80A73.25 73.25 0 0 1 347.46 193.62\" stroke=\"#AFEDF8\"/><path class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__arc\" d=\"M347.46 193.62A73.25 73.25 0 1 1 275.65 134.80\" stroke=\"#5EDBEF\"/><path d=\"M275.65 146.55L275.65 123.05M335.95 195.94L358.98 191.31\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M28.65 320.2V309.6M24.15 314.1L28.65 309.6L33.15 314.1\" stroke=\"#C1C0C1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__clabel\">Daily total avg</span><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__cval\">14h 16m</span><div class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__trend\"><span class=\"x-huckleberry-sleep-trends__bold\">1h</span> more sleep than last week</div></div>",
