   "prompt": "Build a sleep trends donut card like Huckleberry's.\n- 347 x 305 pt on white. Title: Sleep Trends, Lexend Medium 22.8 pt, #45526A.\n- Range row: 7D, 14D, 30D, 90D, 1Y at 69 pt pitch, Lexend Semibold 15.8 pt #39D0E7. Selected: 45.5 pt #36D2E9 circle, white label.\n- Legend: 12 pt dots (nap #AFEDF8, night #5EDBEF), labels Lexend 14.5 pt #888888, values Lexend Semibold 20.4 pt #45526A.\n- Donut: 167 pt across, 20.7 pt ring, flat ends, 2 pt white gaps. Center: Daily total avg over 14h 16m (Lexend Semibold 22.7 pt).\n- Trend: thin up arrow (1.3 pt #C1C0C1), 1h in Nunito Bold, more sleep than last week in Nunito Medium, 14.1 pt #888888.\n- Data rule: arc share = part over total. Nap 3h 7m of 14h 16m = 22% from 12 o'clock; night fills the rest.\n- States: a range tap slides the circle (250 ms spring) and redraws the donut; arcs sweep clockwise in 600 ms.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
